# KNNvKP positions, white to move, for tests/tbpv.py.
#
# KNNvKP because it holds the longest DTZ conversions of any 5-man table, so it
# is where syzygy_extend_pv's step 2 walks far enough to reach the end of the
# 247-slot PV. Random placements, kings apart, black king not already attacked,
# pawn off the promotion ranks -- every line is legal and reachable, so a finding
# here is never an illegal-board false positive.
#
# The ORDER is part of the fixture. The sweep runs one engine with no ucinewgame
# between positions, so what each search finds depends on the table state the
# ones before it left. Position 350 is where a pre-fix binary took SIGSEGV;
# reordering or trimming this file is writing a different test.
